stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PrepareScope
    PrepareScope --> Failed : selected note tree over the evidence limit
    PrepareScope --> ModelTurn
    ModelTurn --> Done : no tool calls, wrote an answer
    ModelTurn --> NudgeToAnswer : no tool calls, no text (first time, not last turn)
    NudgeToAnswer --> ModelTurn : ANSWER_REQUIRED added
    ModelTurn --> Failed : no tool calls, no text again
    ModelTurn --> StoppedAtLimit : tool calls on the last turn
    StoppedAtLimit --> Done : "I stopped before finishing" appended
    ModelTurn --> Operation : one operation call, alone
    ModelTurn --> NotStarted : summarize_view on an empty view
    NotStarted --> ModelTurn : tool result says nothing to summarize
    ModelTurn --> RunTools : other tool calls
    RunTools --> ModelTurn : results appended
    Operation --> [*] : the operation ends the turn (see Summarizing a whole view and Tag proposals)
    Done --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    note right of RunTools
        See Running the tool calls. A turn whose calls all fail counts
        toward MAX_FAILED_TOOL_TURNS; at 2 in a row the
        next turn is the last (ANSWER_NOW added).
    end note
